[Music]  it's already been three years since  miles morales saved brooklyn back then  spider-man into the spider-verse was the  first movie to successfully bring the  concept of the various marvel universes  to the big screen since then every fan  has been looking forward to a sequel  centered around the various neighborhood  spideys we can reassure you we won't  need to wait for ages  based on current information spider-man  into the spider-verse 2 is scheduled to  hit theaters in october 2022  in order to make the time a little more  bearable until then we have already  taken a look at some possible storylines  we will introduce them to you in this  video we hope you enjoy it  considering that the first part had a  lot to offer and that it's been a while  we'll briefly summarize the most  important points  if you haven't seen it yet and don't  want any spoilers  you should hurry up and skip to the next  part  young miles morales was bitten by a  radioactive spider  this happens in the same brooklyn where  peter parker from the famous spiderman  movies of 2002 fights evil as the  friendly neighborhood spider  when he suddenly acquires abilities he  returns to the place where he was bitten  there he finds spider-man fighting  kingpin among other villains  the gangster boss opens a portal to  other universes trying to get his dead  family back  but fails in doing so  nevertheless he manages to kill peter as  new york mourns and mild stands at  peter's grave an older version of peter  unexpectedly shows up  shortly after spider-gwen spider-man 1  and spider-ham also  it quickly turns out that all the  spideys were dragged into this universe  from other ones by kingpin's machine  in spite of all warnings the gangster  boss wants to switch on the machine  again which would lead to the  destruction of the whole city  in the final battle the spider-man  succeed in defeating kingpin and his  gang of villains united  everyone returns to the universes and  miles morales becomes the new friendly  neighborhood spider in new york  so what sort of multiverse spider-man  will we meet in the sequel thanks to the  post-credits scene and some interviews  with the producers we already know a  little bit of information about this  body so we'll provide a law order in the  upcoming movie as expected miles morales  remains the protagonist of the film the  young teenager eventually became the new  spider-man of the city after his victory  over a kingpin  besides we are all curious to see how  the relationship with his father will  evolve after they finally managed to get  together at the end of the last film  as has already been confirmed gwen stacy  will also be back after all spider-gwen  ended up befriending miles and it's  clearly hard for her to say her goodbyes  and return to her universe  gwen gets female support from jessica  drew who most of you probably know as  spider woman as a young girl she was  seriously ill prompting her father to  develop the spider serum to cure her  however  upon injecting it into her she developed  superpowers similar to miles morales  just like him she can also send out an  electric shock also known as a venom  blast  in the comics she first joined hydra  before joining shield whether that will  also be the case and into the spider  verse 2 is yet unclear  we were already introduced to a newcomer  of the second part in the post-credits  scene of the first movie then we see  miguel o'hara also known as spider-man  2099  said spider-man as you can guess is from  the year 2099 where the world is ruled  by corporations and the time of heroes  is long gone o'hara tries to become  spider-man through the use of genetic  manipulation which he ultimately  succeeds in doing unlike his  predecessors he no longer needs web  shooters as he can shoot threats himself  however  he lacks the spider sense that the  others have in return he is able to  paralyze his opponents by biting them  another newcomer is takuyaya mashiro  also known as the japanese spider-man  sure we already had an anime or manga  spidey in the first movie  nevertheless tequila will be based more  on the original the tokyo boy is an  enthusiastic motocross racer until he's  injected with the serum that alters his  genes similar to miguel o'hara  his powers are comparable to those of  peter parker the only real difference is  that his great weakness is the extreme  cold similar to that of real spiders  whether peter b parker will be returning  is not yet certain  at the end of the first part he gets  back to his universe like all the others  and manages to approach mary jane and  new as a result of what he has  experienced thus his life seems to have  a purpose again  in an interview voice actor jake johnson  said that it would break his heart if  you were not allowed to play the role of  the down and out spidey version again  therefore not everything appears to be  cut and dry just yet nothing is known  about potential antagonists so far which  of course leaves plenty of space for  creativity when it comes to the plot of  the second part  fortunately there are already a few  clues regarding the plot so we don't  have to completely speculate here what  will be clear is that there will be a  love affair between miles and gwen this  was already planned to happen in the  first part but then was cut out in  addition spider woman's appearance will  also introduce the plant spinoff this  one supposed to be about gwen stacy  jessica drew and cindy moon also called  silk nothing more is known for sure at  this point  diving into the eventual plot let's  briefly talk about the post-credits  scene once more  there a jump is made into the universe  of miguel o'hara you see a researcher  talking about how the multiverse almost  collapsed but only nearly after all  the woman hands spidey bracelet that can  be used to jump purposefully through the  multiverse this is how miguel heads to  1967 to bring the famous comic book and  meme spider-man into his reality  the end  it's conceivable that spider-man might  need help in his own universe in 2099 as  he cannot cope with a villain there on  his own the film will therefore not be  said in the new york we know but in that  of the future  there the city is divided into two  districts the upper one for the rich  elite and the lower one  superheroes do not actually matter  anymore and are only reminiscent of  stories from brighter days  if everything goes smoothly spider-man  2099 will have the support of at least  three more heroes in fact four if we  take peter b parker into account  possible antagonists can already be  deduced from the comics in them o'hara  usually finds doctor doom or venom since  venom is just getting a second  installment we can very well envision  doctor doom here kingpin's attempt to  mess around with a multiverse could lead  dr doom to develop his own plans to use  the power of different universes for  himself  this would definitely make him one of  the most dangerous opponents for even  without his power he is one of the most  powerful villains  in any case traveling between universes  will probably play a big role perhaps  this will allow to stay longer in  another universe which would no doubt  benefit the romance between miles and  gwen  but of course that's just our theory and  it's not confirmed in any way  those were our facts and theories about  spider-man into the spider-verse 2. what  are your thoughts do you have any ideas  on what the film could look like  let us know in the comments otherwise  all we can do is wait for the first  trailer to come out the movie is  expected to be released in theaters on  october 7th 2022 we're definitely  looking forward to learning more about  miles morales and this spider-verse see  you next time  [Music]  you

